[I] Desktop sync client for Nextcloud

[T] The Nextcloud Desktop Client is a Qt based application to synchronize
[T] files between a Nextcloud server and the local computer, running in the
[T] system tray and supporting virtual files and multiple accounts.

[U] https://github.com/nextcloud/desktop

[A] nextcloud
